<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge unchanched at 75.5500 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge unchanched at 75.5500 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.5500 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Jan 14		  Jan 13</p>
<p> High			     75.5500		 75.5500</p>
<p> Low				76.3000		 76.6500</p>
<p> Open			     75.5700		 75.8200</p>
<p> Close			    75.5500		 75.5500</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  3.770		  11.350</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Jan 14		  Jan 10</p>
<p> Hign			     47.9200		 47.9000</p>
